## Severity & Coverage

**What was assessed:** fault detection from the spectral/envelope evidence{% if history_ran %}, plus the vibration trend over the reading history (unit-relative){% endif %}. Any findings above stand on that evidence alone.

**What was not assessed:** ISO 20816 severity — the severity rating that places the machine in a vibration band. {{ not_assessable_reason | capitalize }}, and severity is a velocity judgement, so it is left unrated. A velocity measurement (mm/s RMS, per ISO 20816) is required to establish it — see *Recommended Follow-up Measurements*.
