## Diagnosis
{% if insufficient %}

**Insufficient data — no diagnosis made.** The reading did not pass quality
checks, so no fault assessment is possible. See *Recommended Follow-up
Measurements* for exactly what to collect next.
{% elif analysis_failed %}

**Analysis failed — no diagnosis made.** The fault screen did not complete on
this reading, so no fault family was assessed and nothing was ruled out. The
measurement itself passed the data-quality checks: this is a failure of the
analysis, not of the data. Re-submit the reading. **The absence of findings
below is not evidence that this machine is healthy.**
{% elif no_findings and unmatched_periodicity %}

**Committed diagnosis: none — but this reading is not clear.**

